e [👽 SUPERNATURAL]","desc":"🌟 BloxLife - Life Simulator\n\nThis game is inspired by Candywriter LLC's BitLife. \n\nLive your life from birth to death! Make choices that shape your destiny. Will you become rich, start a family, or end up in prison?\n\n⭐ FEATURES:\n• Age up year by year and manage your health, happiness, smarts & looks\n• Get married, have kids, and continue as your child when you die\n• Work jobs, go to school, or start your own business\n• Invest in stocks and crypto with live price updates\n• Buy houses, cars, and boats\n• Build relationships with family and friends\n• Join the military or become a criminal\n• Random events every year keep it interesting\n• Start a business\n• Become the PRESIDENT?!\n\n💰 MAKE MONEY:\nTrade cryptocurrency and stocks with real charts. Buy real estate and collect rent. Work your way up to high-paying careers. Every life is different!\n\n\nYour choices matter. Start your life now!\nAll events are fictional and not based on real life events.","path":"/game/77349860902889-bloxlife","slug":"77349860902889-bloxlife","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/429532fbded3fec25c9b5f21318586bc67b62341837b6fbc0bd4f848ff30fd58.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-cc336bb2976ab63e9d21fa4b11b62018/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":11,"visitor":5870699,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-12-09T20:30:45.106Z","creator":{"name":"Dynamite Inc","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":14233281398,"name":"(PT3!!) Critical Revengeance","desc":"Welcome to Critical Revengeance! An open-world game that is a harder spin on the CA Genre (Although still heavily WIP.)\n\nPlease be aware that (MOST) of the songs in CR are from outside sources and are not original, and upon request will be removed if need be.\nWe DO have some official OSTs though.\nAZALI has granted us permission to use their songs, as long as it isn't a commissioned song.\n\nThis game is still in public testing phases, so expect MANY bugs, unfinished content, a lack of content, incorrect balancing, and anything to change. This game is mostly meant for PC, but it has some mobile and console support.\n\nThis game is developed by two people, one working on a backend recode. Game is still getting updated during recode period. Please know that updates will be way slower and inconsistent, and is a passion project.","path":"/game/14233281398-critical-revengeance","slug":"14233281398-critical-revengeance","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d79ea6a06ad714f0bef90ddc9deb579b85c5bc082f1c51af5bc77bb5445a8574.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-0056d15b022d99c2eb4b74fe738c5542/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":11,"visitor":3961048,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-10-12T23:08:19.323Z","creator":{"name":"The Last Strike","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":84593840279371,"name":"raise bob [alpha]","desc":"if bob starves you WILL NOT lose your save!\n\n📝 Update Log: https://devforum.roblox.com/t/raise-bob-update-log/3633944\n\n🔨 This game is developed by a solo developer, so updates may not be frequent!\n⚙️ Inspiration (please check out these games!):\n        raise a floppa\n        raise a bloppa\n\n📅 Release Date: 04/05/2025\n⚠️ Disclaimer: This game is in alpha, which means it's still in the early stages of development, you may encounter bugs and incomplete features.","path":"/game/84593840279371-raise-bob","slug":"84593840279371-raise-bob","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e2dd93efc4610a5c9d784fa234aa125aae5f57df3016886e40a56adc0238bdaa.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e772609c52c2cc2be956944ed5ac7ebd/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":11,"visitor":5448420,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-04T13:34:09.545Z","creator":{"name":"eplcmoon","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":73982574886804,"name":"[UPD 5!] 🚀 Launch Your Rocket","de